        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A. Employees who voluntarily separate from employment are, by definition, considered to have resigned their employment with the University. An employee who retires or otherwise voluntarily separates from a position with the University shall be required to submit a letter of resignation as notice of termination at least fifteen (15) calendar days prior to the effective date of such resignation/termination.",
            "block_bbox": [
